==English==

===Etymology===
Possibly from [[Basque]] ''[[Jainko]]'', [[God]], used in a propaganda song.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈdʒɪŋgɘʊɪz(ɘ)m/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# {{uncountable}} Excessive [[patriotism]] or [[aggressive]] [[nationalism]] especially with regards to foreign policy.
# {{countable}} A jingoistic attitude, comment, etc.

====Synonyms====
* [[chauvinism]]

====Related terms====
* [[jingoist]]
* [[jingoistic]]
* [[jingoistically]]

